### =========================================================================
### JollyRx – Automated RFQ Test Suite
### Target: Local Proxy (http://localhost:3000) & Zoho Flow Webhook
### =========================================================================

### 1. Health Check Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### 2. Assignment Test 1 (NODE-GJ-01 / Paracetamol)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rfq
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "masked_node_id": "NODE-GJ-01",
  "buyer_name": "QA Test Buyer",
  "buyer_email": "qa.test@example.com",
  "target_quantity": 5000
}

### 3. Assignment Test 2 (NODE-MP-03 / Amoxicillin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rfq
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "masked_node_id": "NODE-MP-03",
  "buyer_name": "QA Test Buyer 2",
  "buyer_email": "qa.test2@example.com",
  "target_quantity": 10000
}

### 4. Edge Case: Missing Required Fields (Should return HTTP 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rfq
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "masked_node_id": "NODE-GJ-01",
  "buyer_name": "",
  "buyer_email": "qa.test@example.com",
  "target_quantity": 5000
}

### 5. Edge Case: Invalid Email Format (Should return HTTP 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rfq
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "masked_node_id": "NODE-GJ-01",
  "buyer_name": "QA Test Buyer",
  "buyer_email": "invalid-email-format",
  "target_quantity": 5000
}

### 6. Edge Case: Zero or Negative Quantity (Should return HTTP 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/rfq
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "masked_node_id": "NODE-GJ-01",
  "buyer_name": "QA Test Buyer",
  "buyer_email": "qa.test@example.com",
  "target_quantity": 0
}

